    <string name="about_themes">Themes</string>
    <string name="about_themes_text">NexScreen adapts to your style. You can choose the mode (light, dark or AMOLED black), the color (system dynamic or custom accent), the interface style (Miuix or Material), the ColorSpec and the color theme. You can also set your own wallpaper, enable the glass effect with adjustable intensity, change the interface scale, the font size and type, all from the Theme section.</string>
